<title>USA: TENNIS-U.S. LEADS THE NETHERLANDS 1-0.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-U.S. LEADS THE NETHERLANDS 1-0.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, California 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States led the Netherlands 1-0 after the opening singles match of the Davis Cup quarterfinal tie on Friday:</p>
<p>Andre Agassi (U.S) beat Sjeng Schalken (the Netherlands) 7-6 (8-6) 6-4 7-6 (7-2).</p>
</text>
